ps://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yixiaoer","id":33915732,"login":"yixiaoer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTE1NzMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yixiaoer","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2026-09-21T17:44:04Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"📝 Summary of Changes\r\nFixes #49143.\r\n\r\nReuse the existing generic buffer-use checker `existing is_buffer_used` and remove the weaker scatter-only helper `IsScatterBufferUsed`. Unsafe scatter patterns keep their all-reduce inside the loop.\r\n\r\nAdded eight parameterized minimal-HLO regression cases that check whether the pass hoists the all-reduce or retains it inside the loop. And the tests ran on CPU host.\r\n\r\n🎯 Justification\r\nThe scatter-specific path in `while-loop-all-reduce-code-motion` accepts a select between carry and zero without checking whether its predicate is replicated within the all-reduce group. Hoisting the collective while retaining a select such as `partition_id == 0 ? carry : 0` discards earlier contributions on nonzero partitions.\r\n\r\n🚀 Kind of Contribution\r\n🐛 Bug Fix, 🧪 Tests\r\n\r\n🧪 Unit Tests\r\n```bash\r\nbazel test \\\r\n  //xla/hlo/transforms/collectives:while_loop_all_reduce_code_motion_test \\\r\n  //xla/hlo/